<div class="seom-panel"><h3>Bing URL Submission API</h3><p>This optional direct Bing API is separate from IndexNow and targets Bing only. Microsoft currently recommends IndexNow for most integrations.</p><form method="post" action="<?php echo esc_url(admin_url('admin-post.php')); ?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="seom_search_engine_save"><?php wp_nonce_field('seom_search_engine_save'); ?><label class="seom-toggle-row inline"><span><strong>Enable direct Bing API</strong><small>Use your Bing Webmaster API key for direct Bing-only submissions.</small></span><input type="checkbox" name="bing_api_enabled" value="1" <?php checked((int)seom_get('bing_api_enabled',0),1); ?>></label><label>Bing API Key<input type="password" name="bing_api_key" value="" placeholder="Leave blank to keep the saved key"><small><?php echo SEO_Manager_Search_Engines::bing_key_present()?'A key is already stored securely.':''; ?></small></label><p><button class="button">Save Bing API Settings</button></p></form></div></div>
<div class="seom-panel"><h3>Automatic submission</h3><form method="post" action="<?php echo esc_url(admin_url('admin-post.php')); ?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="seom_search_engine_save"><?php wp_nonce_field('seom_search_engine_save'); ?><div class="seom-toggle-list"><label class="seom-toggle-row"><span><strong>Enable IndexNow</strong><small>Notify participating search engines when published URLs change.</small></span><input type="checkbox" name="indexnow_enabled" value="1" <?php checked((int)seom_get('indexnow_enabled',0),1); ?>></label><label class="seom-toggle-row"><span><strong>Auto-submit updates</strong><small>Queue published and updated same-domain URLs.</small></span><input type="checkbox" name="indexnow_auto_update" value="1" <?php checked((int)seom_get('indexnow_auto_update',1),1); ?>></label><label class="seom-toggle-row"><span><strong>Auto-submit deletions</strong><small>Notify when a published URL moves to Trash.</small></span><input type="checkbox" name="indexnow_auto_delete" value="1" <?php checked((int)seom_get('indexnow_auto_delete',1),1); ?>></label><label class="seom-toggle-row"><span><strong>Include homepage updates</strong><small>Allow the homepage URL to participate when its front-page content updates.</small></span><input type="checkbox" name="indexnow_submit_homepage" value="1" <?php checked((int)seom_get('indexnow_submit_homepage',1),1); ?>></label></div><label>Local daily safety budget<input type="number" name="indexnow_daily_limit" min="1" max="10000" value="<?php echo (int)seom_get('indexnow_daily_limit',200); ?>"><small>This safety limit does not override search-engine quotas.</small></label><p><button class="button button-primary">Save Indexing Settings</button></p></form></div>
